  "turns": [
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0001",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 0.069,
      "end_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "line customer care. This is Daniel. How can I help you today?",
      "word_count": 12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.511,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0002",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 3.68,
      "end_seconds": 12.78,
      "text": "Hi, Daniel. I'm trying to figure out what happened to a refund I asked for. I returned something at one of the stores over a week ago, and the money hasn't come back yet.",
      "word_count": 36,
      "duration_seconds": 9.1,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0003",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 14.14,
      "end_seconds": 20.6,
      "text": "Okay. I'll take a look. Was the item originally ordered online or purchased in store?",
      "word_count": 16,
      "duration_seconds": 6.46,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0004",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 20.72,
      "end_seconds": 26.48,
      "text": "Online, and I returned it to the store. It was a black standing desk converter. It was just too wide for my desk.",
      "word_count": 23,
      "duration_seconds": 5.76,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0005",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 27.5,
      "end_seconds": 33.26,
      "text": "Okay. Got it. Do you have the order number or the return receipt nearby?",
      "word_count": 14,
      "duration_seconds": 5.76,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0006",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 33.32,
      "end_seconds": 38.9,
      "text": "Yeah, I have both. Um, order ends in 5624, and the return receipt ends in 9182.",
      "word_count": 16,
      "duration_seconds": 5.58,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0007",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 40.1,
      "end_seconds": 46.52,
      "text": "Okay. Got it. Um, just one second. And also, what was the email address on the order?",
      "word_count": 17,
      "duration_seconds": 6.42,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0008",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 47.82,
      "end_seconds": 50.86,
      "text": "Teddy.torrez@harbormail.com.",
      "word_count": 4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0009",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 52.34,
      "end_seconds": 55.66,
      "text": "Okay. Just give me one moment, and I'm gonna look that order up.",
      "word_count": 14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0010",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 57.34,
      "end_seconds": 58.04,
      "text": "Okay.",
      "word_count": 1,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": true
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0011",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 67.54,
      "end_seconds": 81.04,
      "text": "Okay. Um, I just found that order. I see one standing desk converter for $186.42 after tax. Does that sound about right?",
      "word_count": 23,
      "duration_seconds": 13.5,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0012",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 81.12,
      "end_seconds": 86.72,
      "text": "Yep. I paid $40 with a Westline gift card, and then the rest should be on my debit.",
      "word_count": 18,
      "duration_seconds": 5.6,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0013",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 88.04,
      "end_seconds": 101.1,
      "text": "Okay. Perfect. Yeah. That, that definitely helps. I can see that the return was accepted at the Eastwood store about nine days ago, and the system shows that the item is back in inventory. So the return itself is actually complete.",
      "word_count": 41,
      "duration_seconds": 13.06,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0014",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 103.36,
      "end_seconds": 118.4,
      "text": "O- oh, okay. I think that's what the person at the store told me, but the email I got is only about $42, so I'm still missing the $146 and the 42 cents. I don't know where that is. It isn't in my account.",
      "word_count": 48,
      "duration_seconds": 15.04,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0015",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 119.54,
      "end_seconds": 130.979,
      "text": "Okay. Understood. Um, the, the $40 portion should have gone back to the gift card. Did you receive a new digital gift card number in that email by any chance?",
      "word_count": 30,
      "duration_seconds": 11.439,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0016",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 132.44,
      "end_seconds": 137.58,
      "text": "Uh, yeah, I did, but I haven't tried it yet. I was just more worried about the debit card.",
      "word_count": 20,
      "duration_seconds": 5.14,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0017",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 139.4,
      "end_seconds": 151.62,
      "text": "Okay. Yeah. That's, um, that's totally fair. Let me go ahead and check the payment history and the card reference. I may need to place you on hold for a few moments while I kind of open the return details.",
      "word_count": 42,
      "duration_seconds": 12.22,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0018",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 151.68,
      "end_seconds": 152.02,
      "text": "Yeah, sure.",
      "word_count": 2,
      "duration_seconds": 0.34,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0019",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 152.95,
      "end_seconds": 154.2,
      "text": "Perfect. One second.",
      "word_count": 3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0020",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 171.16,
      "end_seconds": 179.03,
      "text": "Okay. Thank you so much for waiting. Sorry about the delay. It looks like the gift card refund was issued successfully-",
      "word_count": 21,
      "duration_seconds": 7.87,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0021",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 179.04,
      "end_seconds": 179.07,
      "text": "Mm-hmm",
      "word_count": 2,
      "duration_seconds": 0.03,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": true
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0022",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 179.16,
      "end_seconds": 190.58,
      "text": "... and the debit card refund is showing submitted, um, but it was never received in, like, a settlement confirmation from the payment processor.",
      "word_count": 23,
      "duration_seconds": 11.42,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0023",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 193.38,
      "end_seconds": 201.04,
      "text": "Okay. What does that mean? Did Westline send it or not? 'Cause right now my bank is saying that they don't see a refund or even something pending.",
      "word_count": 29,
      "duration_seconds": 7.66,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0024",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 202.82,
      "end_seconds": 217.06,
      "text": "Yeah. So what that kinda means is that the store register created the refund request, but on our side, our system can't confirm that the bank accepted it. I don't wanna tell you it's on the way when the status kinda says it's incomplete.",
      "word_count": 48,
      "duration_seconds": 14.24,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0025",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 218.96,
      "end_seconds": 221.16,
      "text": "Okay. Um,",
      "word_count": 2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0026",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 222.62,
      "end_seconds": 232.52,
      "text": "I mean, like, I used a different physical card when I bought it because my card was replaced last month. It should be wired or linked to the same checking account, though. Is that potentially an issue?",
      "word_count": 37,
      "duration_seconds": 9.9,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0027",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 234.42,
      "end_seconds": 253.75,
      "text": "I will say it definitely could explain the missing confirmation. Refunds normally route to the underlying account even if a card was replaced, but sometimes the bank has to match the old card token manually. Do you remember what the last four digits of the original card were?",
      "word_count": 48,
      "duration_seconds": 19.33,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0028",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 255.28,
      "end_seconds": 261.44,
      "text": "Yeah. Um, 2047. The new one ends in 8163.",
      "word_count": 9,
      "duration_seconds": 6.16,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0029",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 262.44,
      "end_seconds": 265.42,
      "text": "Okay. Let me take a look to see if that's on the purchase.",
      "word_count": 14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0030",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 269.12,
      "end_seconds": 289.44,
      "text": "Yeah. So from what I'm seeing, that does match what I see on the purchase. I'm going to open a payment trace using the original card reference, and what I'm gonna do then is attach the store return receipt. That will let our payments team confirm whether the bank rejected it or whether it's waiting on it to kinda get settled.",
      "word_count": 65,
      "duration_seconds": 20.32,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0031",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 291.08,
      "end_seconds": 292.82,
      "text": "Um, can you just send it to the new card?",
      "word_count": 10,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0032",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 294.42,
      "end_seconds": 311.219,
      "text": "Unfortunately, not while the first refund request is still open. If I created another refund right now, you could receive both, and then the system kind of blocks that. The payment team has to close or cancel the original request first.",
      "word_count": 41,
      "duration_seconds": 16.799,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0033",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 313.14,
      "end_seconds": 322.22,
      "text": "Okay. How long does that usually take? 'Cause I returned it because I needed the money back, and nine days already kind of feels like a long time.",
      "word_count": 28,
      "duration_seconds": 9.08,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0034",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 323.4,
      "end_seconds": 340.74,
      "text": "I agree, um, that this definitely should've been cleared by now. Um, the review window is usually three to five business days from today. Many are resolved sooner, but unfortunately, I just can't promise you a specific day until the processor kind of responds.",
      "word_count": 46,
      "duration_seconds": 17.34,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0035",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 340.82,
      "end_seconds": 343.1,
      "text": "Okay. So you're saying I might be waiting another week?",
      "word_count": 11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0036",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 345.1,
      "end_seconds": 363.96,
      "text": "Uh, potentially. Although five business days is outside the review window, if the bank confirms the accepted refund, we'll go ahead and send you the settlement reference that the bank can locate it. If the bank rejected it, Westline can reissue the amount using an approved alternative method.",
      "word_count": 49,
      "duration_seconds": 18.86,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0037",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 366.04,
      "end_seconds": 370.9,
      "text": "Would that be a check? I don't want store credit for the whole amount, though",
      "word_count": 16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.86,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0038",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 372.78,
      "end_seconds": 391.22,
      "text": "It would not automatically become store credit. Depending on the processor results, the option may include the replacement card or mailed check, and the payments team will kind of confirm with you the available option before reiss-reissuing anything.",
      "word_count": 39,
      "duration_seconds": 18.44,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0039",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 393.1,
      "end_seconds": 399.14,
      "text": "Okay. Um, can you also confirm the $40 gift card actually works? Like, I don't want another problem.",
      "word_count": 19,
      "duration_seconds": 6.04,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0040",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 400.94,
      "end_seconds": 404.34,
      "text": "Yes. Um, give me one second. Let me just check that balance for you.",
      "word_count": 14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0041",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 409.1,
      "end_seconds": 411.02,
      "text": "Yeah, so it looks like on my end",
      "word_count": 8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0042",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 412.72,
      "end_seconds": 416.88,
      "text": "that the balance and the digital gift card have $40 available.",
      "word_count": 11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0043",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 418.16,
      "end_seconds": 422.84,
      "text": "It has not been used, and the number in the email, uh, still looks to be active.",
      "word_count": 17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0044",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 424.08,
      "end_seconds": 425.22,
      "text": "Okay.",
      "word_count": 1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.14,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": true
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0045",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 427.7,
      "end_seconds": 431.66,
      "text": "Okay, perfect. Um, so I've kind of opened up",
      "word_count": 10,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0046",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 432.92,
      "end_seconds": 450.96,
      "text": "the payment trace for the remaining $146.42, and the case number is WST735204. And I'm also noting that your original card was actually replaced, but the checking account remains open.",
      "word_count": 32,
      "duration_seconds": 18.04,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0047",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 452.78,
      "end_seconds": 453.74,
      "text": "Can you email that to me?",
      "word_count": 6,
      "duration_seconds": 0.96,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0048",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 454.68,
      "end_seconds": 468.4,
      "text": "Yes. Um, I can go ahead and just send you a confirmation to your email on the order. Um, what it'll do is it should list out the amount under review, the last four digits of the original card, and then a potential expected response window.",
      "word_count": 47,
      "duration_seconds": 13.72,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0049",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 470.34,
      "end_seconds": 477.02,
      "text": "Okay. Okay, I see it. It says not to contact the store. Does that mean that the store can't do anything right now?",
      "word_count": 24,
      "duration_seconds": 6.68,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0050",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 479.3,
      "end_seconds": 495.78,
      "text": "Yes. So the store kind of completed, um, their part of the whole return process. From here, the payments team and the card processor have to kind of handle this, so calling the store would not kind of, uh, speed up the trace in this case.",
      "word_count": 46,
      "duration_seconds": 16.48,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0051",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 497.08,
      "end_seconds": 504.62,
      "text": "Okay. Um, I also had a small overdraft fee because I was expecting this money back. Is that something Westline covers?",
      "word_count": 21,
      "duration_seconds": 7.54,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0052",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 506.58,
      "end_seconds": 526.72,
      "text": "I can't approve a bank fee while the trace is open. Um, for right now, I can document it, um, and once the refund outcome is confirmed, customer service relations can kind of review any supporting statement you choose to provide. I will say I don't want to promise any sort of reimbursement, but the note will be attached to this case.",
      "word_count": 64,
      "duration_seconds": 20.14,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0053",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 528.34,
      "end_seconds": 530.66,
      "text": "Okay, bet. Um, I just wanted it on record.",
      "word_count": 9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0054",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 531.86,
      "end_seconds": 548.04,
      "text": "Okay, perfect. Yeah. Um, I just put it in on record. If you don't want to receive an update by the end of the fifth business day or if you don't, um, reply to the case email or call us at the number, um, you won't need to explain the return again.",
      "word_count": 55,
      "duration_seconds": 16.18,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0055",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 549.22,
      "end_seconds": 552.04,
      "text": "Okay. And if the return appears before then, do I need to call?",
      "word_count": 13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0056",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 553.4,
      "end_seconds": 561.16,
      "text": "No. So the processor should update the case automatically, and you should receive a closure email once the settlement is confirmed.",
      "word_count": 21,
      "duration_seconds": 7.76,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0057",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 562.84,
      "end_seconds": 567.44,
      "text": "Okay. All right. Well, I still wish we were back today, but this makes more sense to me now.",
      "word_count": 19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0058",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 569.76,
      "end_seconds": 581.46,
      "text": "Yeah, I totally understand you. So sorry again for the trouble. The gift card portion is available now, and the card portion is kind of just actively under review. If there's anything else from the order that you want me to check, just let me know.",
      "word_count": 47,
      "duration_seconds": 11.7,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0059",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 582.24,
      "end_seconds": 583.56,
      "text": "Okay, I'm good now. That's everything.",
      "word_count": 8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0060",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 584.68,
      "end_seconds": 591.18,
      "text": "Okay. All right, Teddy. Um, keep the case email for reference, and we'll contact you as soon as the payment team responds.",
      "word_count": 23,
      "duration_seconds": 6.5,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0061",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 592.32,
      "end_seconds": 593.92,
      "text": "All right. Thanks, Daniel.",
      "word_count": 4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0062",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 593.96,
      "end_seconds": 595.4,
      "text": "You're welcome. Take care. Have a good day",
      "word_count": 9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    }
  ],
